king our predictions for the season, sealing them in an envelope and locking them away for 38 Gameweeks! We'll look back at them at the end of the season to see just how wrong we were 😂\n\n\n💬 *YOUR TURN!* Who wins the Premier League? Who gets the most FPL points? Who's the surprise breakout player? And most importantly… *HAALAND OR NO HAALAND?*\n\n\nDrop your predictions in the live chat and comments!\n\n\nSam and Lee are back for their *TENTH SEASON of FPL Family!* 🎉\n\n\nWhether you're a seasoned FPL manager or you're playing Fantasy Premier League for the first time, we're here to help you make those final GW1 decisions, find the best players and hopefully avoid those early-season disasters!\n\n\nA massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos ❤️\n\n\n---\n\n\n🚀 *SUPPORT FPL FAMILY ON PATREON*\n\n\nJoin our FPL community for FREE or support the channel and get access to:\n\n\n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Manager of the Month Competitions – MONTHLY PRIZES!\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers\n     \n     \n     \n\n👉   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUVhnMHczaVRiaWxWVEpHQUpZR0hTTXxBR3JiS2FtRmNvaHdtcUpqVnNUSDRVNzlmT215ckFhYUg2TzkxQkVZRjM1d3pEMW03bzQyZm8zNVRUV3VFWGdjc0VUUTFNU1hCYWJfSEN2RnAxS3A0NVhBRU5iYm96cWxRME51\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=2_Mj7p7Yvu0)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUVhnMHczaVRiaWxWVEpHQUpZR0hTTXxBR3JiS2FtRmNvaHdtcUpqVnNUSDRVNzlmT215ckFhYUg2TzkxQkVZRjM1d3pEMW03bzQyZm8zNVRUV3VFWGdjc0VUUTFNU1hCYWJfSEN2RnAxS3A0NVhBRU5iYm96cWxRME51\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=2_Mj7p7Yvu0) \n\n---\n\n📊 *JOIN THE FPL FAMILY FPL MINI-LEAGUE!*\n\nLeague Code: *55fqu1*\n\n---\n\nJoin us over on FOOTIUM\n\nhttps://footium.club/game/social/frie... (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVEJxNmgyLXlsSjBhMmtLOFNmSGE0dHxBR3JiS2FuX0o5MHZsMWxjWnpkU1c5bWxZbkpnRUNFS2p6Y1NVOGFGY0pRRC1UeERaSDhSZ3Fic0NiOWFWMVpTSlZWZlBIb2diV196ZVd1bFhUN1o5QTcwUnplU25lZE5DcmZm\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Ffootium.club%2Fgame%2Fsocial%2Ffriends%3Fjoin_code%3DOTI2MDoxMjk6Y2Y5NTkxODA4OTkzZWYwZDE3YmUyZmIyZDgwZDllZDExODA5ZDE3ZDBjOTVjMmRjNWMxZjcyZDI5ODA3NTI2Yzox%26utm_campaign%3Ds22%26utm_source%3Dfplfamily%26utm_medium%3Dcreator%26utm_content%3Dstream1\u0026v=2_Mj7p7Yvu0) \n\n---\n\n🎧 *LISTEN TO THE FPL FAMILY PODCAST*\n\nAlso available on your favourite podcast platforms:\n\n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVDhTX2tvZG9WUHBBOFpxYWxFQVIya3xBR3JiS2FtNHZwTW83dkoxbFJWMDV6YlB0LTZIN3g0WFBsVzNaLURTN21pSFBFLTdXaVBWb09nRVZuRFh5b0RZeEl3QjNPRkZIV0hKU2pmSmRSVm14WEd5OXA5NE4xa3FYSi1w\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=2_Mj7p7Yvu0)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVDhTX2tvZG9WUHBBOFpxYWxFQVIya3xBR3JiS2FtNHZwTW83dkoxbFJWMDV6YlB0LTZIN3g0WFBsVzNaLURTN21pSFBFLTdXaVBWb09nRVZuRFh5b0RZeEl3QjNPRkZIV0hKU2pmSmRSVm14WEd5OXA5NE4xa3FYSi1w\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=2_Mj7p7Yvu0) \nhttps://audioboom.com/channels/5010221 (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVE92RHdTT0h2bk1TaUhSNXlfUjBTMXxBR3JiS2Ftb3hPUmJOcmVyTS1hYzlwMDYzbkJWeWlpbmZvQld3enBDM2QwaE01akx0R3dsNWliOUhySWVrZUdZQmt0cGd5V3Y0c1N0eWtQYVRTRTBHQkRNSEdoLWhJbXhjY0kx\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Faudioboom.com%2Fchannels%2F5010221\u0026v=2_Mj7p7Yvu0) \n\nSearch *'FPL Family'* on Spotify, Apple Podcasts and Deezer.\n\n---\n\n📈 *FPL STATS \u0026 PLAYER RATINGS*\n\nStats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.\n\nBecome a member here:\nhttp: